WEBVTT

05:29.863 --> 05:33.323
<b>That said, mononoke rarely
cause any major incidents.</b>

05:33.743 --> 05:34.573
<b>Recently,</b>

05:34.613 --> 05:36.493
<b>we've dealt mostly with
those of the human kind.</b>

05:36.903 --> 05:38.033
<b>In other words,</b>

05:38.113 --> 05:40.913
<b>guarding VIPs and investigating
dangerous organizations.</b>
